    a("Reading", 0, "sequence-cue", "Before unlocking the shed, Ren checked the weather. After opening it, Ren carried the tools outside.", "Which clue helps me place the weather check in the sequence?", "Before unlocking the shed, Ren checked the weather", "What action does the word before place ahead of unlocking the shed?", ["before", "unlock", "weather", "sequence"], "Use the explicit time relation, without introducing another event.")
