    m("Reading", 3, "supplement-missing", "The paper says robustness checks appear in Supplement C. Supplement C is not provided in the reading packet.", "Which robustness checks actually succeeded?", "Can we obtain Supplement C to inspect the reported robustness results?", ["supplement", "robust", "result", "obtain"], "Results in an unavailable supplement cannot be supplied from its mention.")
