    a("English", 2, "hedged-claim", "The evidence comes from a small exploratory sample. The revision guide recommends language that marks uncertainty rather than universal claims.", "How should the strength of my wording relate to this evidence?", "language that marks uncertainty rather than universal claims", "Which words in your claim could reflect the limits of the exploratory sample?", ["uncertain", "limit", "sample", "claim", "word"], "Align claim strength with evidence without falsely implying that hedging repairs study design.")
